				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Aegnew is an original warrior created before ther was such a thing as an expansion in EQ. Aegnew has taveled long and far in the persuit of adventure and new foes. I love to play EQ and were it not for the demise of my last guild, Reconstructed, I still would have been playing. After Recon died, so to speak, I joined AF only to see it founder as well. So for me, it was time for a break, after a few months of EQ2 I lost interest. Of course I came right back to that which has been the greatest fun and enjoyment for me, EQ, playing with the few remaining friends left and still managing to make new ones as time goes on.
<br />

<br />
Evoll is a long-time friend of mine going back over 3 years now I think. We were in Forlorn together ages ago now it seems. 
<br />

<br />
I have been on raids as well with Darnok. He has known me in passing for some time. 
<br />

<br />
Anthem has always been a great group of people, very friendly and helpful to say the least. Evoll has offered to sponsor me as a PM in the past, but my schedule and time would not allow early morning play for me.
<br />
While I do work a lot, I do have free time to attend raids and play EQ about 3-4 days a week. I mainly work Fri, Sat, Sun, but have every other sunday off, and unless working extra that is a set schedule. 
<br />

<br />
I would like an opportunity to become a Prospective Member of Anthem.
<br />

<br />
Aegnew has a modest set of gear, mainly up to date as far as LDON and some GoD augments and a few pieces of Time gear. Aegnew has 800aa, all leader aa,  and imo can tank anything out there with proper instruction and healing of course. I have been MT, ST, RT and have done all fight thru PoP into GoD and some of OoW. I can take orders well, I am after all a nurse in RL. I look forward to seeing raid mobs die, and I'm eager to take feedback on how to change or modify what I'm doing to improve. I like to see things done well, so tell me please if thing need to be modified =)
<br />

<br />
***Edited: I do have a lvl 69 cleric 400aa, Alderon, and a 68 chanter 200aa. Miaagi the chanter has done a couple raids with Anthem*** 
<br />

<br />
My goals are to see the end of Time regularly, progress thru GoD and into Qvic and see end game OoW by the end of this summer. I am personally looking to group in OoW GoD and DoN as often as I am on line to do so when we are not raiding. I aspire to 12.5k hp unbuffed and 1200aa. Below you will find a link to my magelo.</span><span class="postbody"><br />_________________<br />Aegnew 70 Warrior Eci
